{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":126829,"duration_api_ms":131418,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。CLIP-ViT 作为独立 VL-pretrained encoder 落入 SigLIP 附近区间，\n  消除 SigLIP-specific confound，将 Claim 1 从 \"SigLIP dominance\" 升级为 \"VL-pretrained\n  encoder dominance\"。LIBERO-Spatial 全面复现核心排序和训练不变性，将所有 Claim 的\n  泛化范围从 single-benchmark 扩展到 cross-benchmark。CKA-RSA dissociation 在两个\n  benchmark 上均成立，作为第四个 finding 稳固。标题 \"Where Do Actions Come From?\" 可用。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_012: CLIP-ViT Pretraining Control\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"CLIP-ViT Pretraining Control\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      用 CLIP ViT-L/14 (OpenAI) 替代 SigLIP 作为 standalone vision encoder，\n      提取 LIBERO-Goal 相同 10 task 的特征，计算 RSA、CKA、functional probe R²，\n      与 SigLIP+Projector 和 DINO 三方对比。目的：区分 \"VL pretraining 通用贡献\"\n      vs \"SigLIP 特异性\"。\n    expected_results:\n      # RSA 指标\n      clip_vit_rsa_pooled: 0.553\n      clip_vit_rsa_per_task_mean: 0.548\n      clip_vit_rsa_bootstrap_ci: [0.47, 0.63]\n      # 对比锚点\n      siglip_projector_rsa: 0.615\n      dino_rsa: 0.388\n      gap_clip_vs_siglip: -0.062\n      gap_clip_vs_dino: +0.165\n      # Bootstrap: CLIP vs SigLIP\n      bootstrap_clip_vs_siglip_delta: -0.062\n      bootstrap_clip_vs_siglip_ci: [-0.14, 0.02]\n      bootstrap_clip_vs_siglip_p: 0.08\n      # Bootstrap: CLIP vs DINO\n      bootstrap_clip_vs_dino_delta: 0.165\n      bootstrap_clip_vs_dino_ci: [0.08, 0.25]\n      bootstrap_clip_vs_dino_p: 0.001\n      # Functional probe\n      clip_vit_action_probe_R2: 0.695\n      clip_vit_action_delta_R2: 0.108\n      # CKA\n      clip_vit_linear_cka: 0.076\n      clip_vit_rdm_cka: 0.248\n      # 三方排序\n      rsa_ordering: \"SigLIP (0.615) > CLIP (0.553) > DINO (0.388)\"\n      probe_ordering: \"DINO (0.712) ≈ SigLIP (0.706) ≈ CLIP (0.695) >> LLM_img_mean (0.683)\"\n      cka_ordering: \"SigLIP (0.081) ≈ CLIP (0.076) > DINO (0.066)\"\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      CLIP ViT-L 与 SigLIP 同属 VL contrastive pretrained encoder 族，训练目标均为\n      image-text alignment（CLIP 用 softmax cross-entropy，SigLIP 用 sigmoid pairwise loss）。\n      两者在 ImageNet zero-shot 上表现接近（CLIP ViT-L ~75.5%, SigLIP ~78%），说明\n      learned visual representation 质量相当。RSA 预测 CLIP 略低于 SigLIP（0.553 vs 0.615）\n      有两个原因：(1) SigLIP 的 sigmoid loss 更好地保留 fine-grained 距离结构（softmax\n      跨 batch normalization 会压缩 hard negative 的梯度信号），(2) OpenVLA 的 projector\n      是针对 SigLIP 输出空间训练的，CLIP 特征经过不同的 normalization 和 embedding space，\n      几何对齐自然略差。但 CLIP 远高于 DINO（+0.165）是因为 VL pretraining 赋予的\n      language grounding 使 representation 空间的距离结构天然更贴近 task-conditioned\n      action structure——action 空间由 language-described goals 划分，VL encoder 在\n      pretraining 时已学会按语义组织视觉特征。DINO 虽然 action R² 与 VL encoder\n      相当（self-supervised 特征包含充分的 positional/state 信息），但其几何结构按\n      visual similarity 而非 semantic similarity 组织，导致 RSA 低。CLIP vs SigLIP\n      的 bootstrap CI 预计包含 0（p~0.08），说明两者差异不显著——这正是 best tier 所需：\n      证明 VL pretraining 是通用有效的，而非 SigLIP 特异的。\n\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: Vision Encoder RSA Comparison (LIBERO-Goal)\"\n        columns: [Model, Pretraining, RSA_ρ, 95%_CI, Action_R², Delta_R²]\n        rows:\n          - [SigLIP+Proj, \"VL (sigmoid)\", 0.615, \"[0.53, 0.70]\", 0.706, 0.118]\n          - [CLIP_ViT-L, \"VL (softmax)\", 0.553, \"[0.47, 0.63]\", 0.695, 0.108]\n          - [DINOv2, \"Self-supervised\", 0.388, \"[0.30, 0.47]\", 0.712, 0.100]\n          - [VLA_img_mean_L23, \"VL+FT\", 0.501, \"[0.42, 0.58]\", 0.683, 0.122]\n\n      - title: \"Table: Pairwise Bootstrap Tests\"\n        columns: [Comparison, Delta, 95%_CI, p_value, Significant]\n        rows:\n          - [CLIP_vs_SigLIP, -0.062, \"[-0.14, 0.02]\", 0.08, \"No\"]\n          - [CLIP_vs_DINO, +0.165, \"[0.08, 0.25]\", 0.001, \"Yes\"]\n          - [CLIP_vs_VLA_img_mean, +0.052, \"[-0.03, 0.13]\", 0.10, \"No\"]\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: RSA ρ 四组对比 (SigLIP / CLIP / VLA_img_mean / DINO)，含 bootstrap 95% CI error bars。关键视觉信息：SigLIP 和 CLIP 的 CI 重叠，两者均显著高于 DINO。中间插入 VLA_img_mean 显示 LLM degradation 效应。\"\n      - \"Scatter plot (supplementary): CLIP ViT-L per-task RSA vs SigLIP per-task RSA，10 个点沿对角线分布，Pearson r > 0.85，说明两个 VL encoder 在 task 维度上行为一致。\"\n\n    analysis: >\n      CLIP RSA=0.553 落入 best tier 预期的 [0.50, 0.60] 区间。与 SigLIP 的差异\n      不显著（p=0.08, CI 包含 0），而与 DINO 差异高度显著（p=0.001）。这建立了一个\n      clean 的三级结构：VL-pretrained encoder 族 (SigLIP ≈ CLIP, RSA ~0.55-0.62) >>\n      Self-supervised (DINO, RSA ~0.39) >> LLM degraded (img_mean ~0.50)。\n      Functional probe R² 的三方近似相等（DINO 0.712 ≈ SigLIP 0.706 ≈ CLIP 0.695）\n      再次确认 geometric-functional dissociation：action information 的存在（R²）不依赖\n      pretraining 方式，但几何对齐（RSA）依赖 VL pretraining。\n      论文 Claim 1 可从 \"SigLIP dominance\" 安全地泛化为 \"VL-pretrained encoder dominance\"。\n      Discussion 中将 SigLIP vs CLIP 的微小差异归因于 loss function 差异（sigmoid vs softmax）\n      和 OpenVLA projector 的 SigLIP-specific 训练，但强调这不影响主结论。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # plan_010: LIBERO-Spatial Cross-Benchmark\n  # ============================================================\n  - name: \"LIBERO-Spatial Cross-Benchmark Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      在 LIBERO-Spatial 的 10 个 task 上完整复现 LIBERO-Goal 的全部分析流程：\n      (1) 四条件 RSA (trained/untrained × with/no-inst image_mean)，\n      (2) SigLIP+Projector RSA，(3) DINO RSA，\n      (4) per-layer degradation curve，(5) bootstrap CI on training effect，\n      (6) functional probe (projector / LLM img_mean / readout / untrained readout)，\n      (7) CKA verification。验证三条 Claim 跨 benchmark 泛化。\n    expected_results:\n      # === RSA Core ===\n      siglip_projector_rsa: 0.587\n      siglip_projector_rsa_ci: [0.50, 0.67]\n      trained_with_inst_image_mean_rsa: 0.482\n      trained_with_inst_peak_layer: 21\n      untrained_with_inst_image_mean_rsa: 0.468\n      untrained_with_inst_peak_layer: 20\n      trained_no_inst_image_mean_rsa: 0.479\n      untrained_no_inst_image_mean_rsa: 0.463\n      dino_rsa: 0.371\n\n      # === Ordering Verification ===\n      rsa_ordering: \"SigLIP (0.587) >> VLA_trained (0.482) ≈ VLA_untrained (0.468) >> DINO (0.371)\"\n      ordering_matches_libero_goal: true\n\n      # === Effect Size Comparison (vs LIBERO-Goal) ===\n      libero_goal_siglip_rsa: 0.615\n      libero_spatial_vs_goal_siglip_ratio: 0.955\n      libero_goal_gap_siglip_vs_vla: 0.114\n      libero_spatial_gap_siglip_vs_vla: 0.105\n      effect_size_within_15pct: true\n\n      # === Training Invariance (Claim 3) ===\n      training_delta_image_mean: 0.014\n      training_delta_bootstrap_ci: [-0.04, 0.06]\n      training_delta_p: 0.22\n      training_delta_significant: false\n      instruction_delta_trained: -0.003\n      instruction_delta_untrained: 0.005\n\n      # === 2x2 Matrix ===\n      two_by_two_matrix:\n        trained_with_inst: 0.482\n        trained_no_inst: 0.479\n        untrained_with_inst: 0.468\n        untrained_no_inst: 0.463\n      two_by_two_band: \"[0.46, 0.49]\"\n      bootstrap_2x2_ci_includes_zero: true\n\n      # === Per-Layer Degradation ===\n      proj_to_L1_drop_trained: 0.19\n      proj_to_L1_drop_untrained: 0.14\n      total_degradation: 0.105\n      pattern: \"non-monotonic, consistent with LIBERO-Goal\"\n\n      # === Functional Probe ===\n      projector_action_R2: 0.688\n      trained_image_mean_best_R2: 0.662\n      trained_image_mean_best_layer: 18\n      trained_readout_best_R2: 0.715\n      trained_readout_best_layer: 18\n      untrained_readout_best_R2: 0.669\n      untrained_readout_best_layer: 31\n      bootstrap_proj_vs_img_mean:\n        delta: 0.026\n        ci: [0.012, 0.041]\n        p: 0.002\n      bootstrap_trained_vs_untrained_readout:\n        delta: 0.046\n        ci: [0.030, 0.062]\n        p: 0.0001\n      readout_concentration_confirmed: true\n\n      # === DINO Functional ===\n      dino_action_R2: 0.693\n      dino_vs_proj_delta: 0.005\n      dino_vs_proj_p: 0.28\n      dino_approx_proj: true\n      geometric_functional_dissociation_rsa_gap: 0.216\n\n      # === CKA Verification ===\n      cka_linear_trained_L21: 0.079\n      cka_linear_untrained_L20: 0.085\n      cka_linear_projector: 0.077\n      cka_linear_dino: 0.062\n      cka_ordering: \"untrained > trained > projector > DINO\"\n      cka_rsa_dissociation_replicated: true\n      cka_last_preaction_trained: 0.121\n\n      # === Action Delta Probe ===\n      projector_delta_R2: 0.109\n      trained_delta_R2: 0.113\n      delta_probe_gap: -0.004\n      delta_probe_ci_includes_zero: true\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      LIBERO-Spatial 与 LIBERO-Goal 共享相同的 LIBERO kitchen 环境和物体集，但 task\n      定义侧重空间关系（\"put X next to Y\", \"put X on top of Y\"）而非目标状态差异。\n      这意味着：(1) 视觉场景相似度更高（物体相同，只是空间配置不同），action 空间的\n      task 间区分度可能略低，预期 RSA 绝对值略低于 LIBERO-Goal（SigLIP 0.587 vs 0.615，\n      差约 5%）；(2) 但相对排序不变——VL pretraining 赋予的 semantic geometric alignment\n      不依赖 task 定义方式，SigLIP 和 CLIP 在 spatial reasoning 上同样优于 DINO；\n      (3) 训练不变性甚至可能更强——LIBERO-Spatial 的 action 分布更集中（主要是 pick-place\n      的空间变体），LLM 层面的 distributed representation 更难区分 trained/untrained。\n\n      Readout concentration 的 effect size 预期与 LIBERO-Goal 高度一致（Δ≈0.046），\n      因为 readout 机制是 architecture-level 行为：self-attention 将 image token 信息\n      汇聚到 prediction position 的能力由训练学得，与具体 benchmark 的 task 定义无关。\n      Untrained readout R²=0.669 仍低于 projector 0.688，确认 redistribution requires training。\n\n      DINO 在 LIBERO-Spatial 上 action R² 同样接近 projector（0.693 vs 0.688），\n      但 RSA gap 扩大（0.371 vs 0.587，gap=0.216 > LIBERO-Goal 的 0.227），因为\n      spatial task 更依赖 semantic layout understanding，DINO 的 geometric structure\n      更不匹配。这进一步强化 geometric-functional dissociation。\n\n      CKA 排序反转在 LIBERO-Spatial 上同样复现（untrained > trained > projector > DINO），\n      因为 CKA 捕捉的 global structure preservation 是 LLM 架构的固有属性，不依赖 benchmark。\n\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Table: RSA Cross-Benchmark Comparison\"\n        columns: [Model, LIBERO-Goal_RSA, LIBERO-Spatial_RSA, Ratio]\n        rows:\n          - [SigLIP+Proj, 0.615, 0.587, 0.955]\n          - [VLA_trained_img_mean, 0.501, 0.482, 0.962]\n          - [VLA_untrained_img_mean, 0.485, 0.468, 0.965]\n          - [DINO, 0.388, 0.371, 0.956]\n\n      - title: \"Table: 2×2 Matrix — LIBERO-Spatial\"\n        columns: [Condition, with_inst, no_inst, Instruction_Δ]\n        rows:\n          - [Trained, 0.482, 0.479, -0.003]\n          - [Untrained, 0.468, 0.463, +0.005]\n          - [Training_Δ, +0.014, +0.016, \"\"]\n\n      - title: \"Table: Functional Probe Cross-Benchmark\"\n        columns: [Model, LIBERO-Goal_R², LIBERO-Spatial_R², Δ]\n        rows:\n          - [SigLIP+Proj, 0.706, 0.688, -0.018]\n          - [Trained_img_mean, 0.683, 0.662, -0.021]\n          - [Trained_readout, 0.731, 0.715, -0.016]\n          - [Untrained_readout, 0.686, 0.669, -0.017]\n          - [DINO, 0.712, 0.693, -0.019]\n\n      - title: \"Table: Readout Concentration Bootstrap (LIBERO-Spatial)\"\n        columns: [Comparison, Δ, 95%_CI, p_value]\n        rows:\n          - [Proj_vs_img_mean_L18, +0.026, \"[0.012, 0.041]\", 0.002]\n          - [Trained_vs_untrained_readout, +0.046, \"[0.030, 0.062]\", \"<0.0001\"]\n          - [Training_effect_RSA, +0.014, \"[-0.04, 0.06]\", 0.22]\n\n    figures_description:\n      - >\n        Paired bar chart: LIBERO-Goal vs LIBERO-Spatial RSA 四组对比（SigLIP / VLA trained /\n        VLA untrained / DINO），每组两根柱子（Goal 浅色, Spatial 深色），含 95% CI error bars。\n        关键视觉信息：两个 benchmark 的柱子高度几乎平行下移 ~5%，排序完全一致。\n      - >\n        Per-layer RSA degradation curve overlay: LIBERO-Goal (实线) vs LIBERO-Spatial (虚线)，\n        trained with-inst 条件。两条曲线形状高度吻合（Proj→L1 大幅下降，中间层非单调恢复），\n        Spatial 曲线整体偏低约 0.02。标注 projector baseline 水平线。\n      - >\n        Readout concentration scatter: x 轴 LIBERO-Goal (trained readout R² - untrained readout R²),\n        y 轴 LIBERO-Spatial 同指标，10 个 task 散点。Points 聚集在对角线右上方（正象限），\n        说明 readout concentration effect 在两个 benchmark 上 per-task 一致。\n      - >\n        CKA-RSA dissociation 双面板图 (supplementary): 左面板 LIBERO-Goal，右面板 LIBERO-Spatial，\n        每面板四组柱子（trained/untrained/proj/DINO），RSA 用蓝色、CKA 用橙色。\n        两面板均显示排序反转模式：RSA proj>trained>untrained>DINO，CKA untrained>trained>proj>DINO。\n\n    analysis: >\n      LIBERO-Spatial 完整复现三条 Claim 的核心证据：\n\n      **Claim 1 (Vision Encoder Dominance)**:\n      SigLIP RSA=0.587 >> VLA 0.482 >> DINO 0.371，排序一致，effect size 在 ±15%\n      内（ratio 0.955-0.965）。DINO ≈ Proj in R²（0.693 vs 0.688, p=0.28）但\n      RSA gap=0.216，geometric-functional dissociation 在第二个 benchmark 复现。\n\n      **Claim 2 (LLM Redistributes)**:\n      Proj→L1 drop ~0.19（32%），per-layer 非单调模式一致。Readout concentration\n      confirmed：trained readout R²=0.715 > proj 0.688 > untrained readout 0.669。\n      CKA 排序反转复现。\n\n      **Claim 3 (Routing Without Creating)**:\n      Training delta RSA=0.014, CI=[-0.04, 0.06], p=0.22——不显著，invariance 成立。\n      2×2 matrix 全部落入 [0.46, 0.49] band。Readout Δ=0.046, CI=[0.030, 0.062],\n      p<0.0001——routing effect 高度显著且 effect size 与 LIBERO-Goal 几乎相同（0.045）。\n\n      所有核心数值的 cross-benchmark ratio 在 0.95-0.97 之间，说明 benchmark 选择\n      对绝对值有微小影响（LIBERO-Spatial 的空间任务区分度略低）但对结论无任何影响。\n      这为论文提供了 \"replicated across benchmarks\" 的泛化声明。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"eaed3793-2e40-489b-be1f-0a1cbb2b53bf","total_cost_usd":0.3549315,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25544,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":6749,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25544,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":6